                    "email": "noreply@anthropic.com",
                    "name": "Claude"
                },
                "message": "✨ Make a backlink-check result an Embark target again after sp-copy-last-message\n\nsp-copy-last-message gets a hook so a module can return the copied text as a\npropertized string; sp-vulpea-backlink-check remembers its recent results and\nrestores them there. While the message is still in the echo area, embark-act\nworks on it directly and nothing is copied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAjRWkNrzYxSeHCHJC",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "39fb6a4f200fa6024a1b79fb9119db5cdf0bce64",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/trees/39fb6a4f200fa6024a1b79fb9119db5cdf0bce64"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/commits/88cab285c188e875bdb802422b52e120c22d3325",
                "verification": {
